libvterm 0.3.3
https://www.leonerd.org.uk/code/libvterm/
Upstream release: https://www.leonerd.org.uk/code/libvterm/libvterm-0.3.3.tar.gz
SHA-256: 09156f43dd2128bd347cbeebe50d9a571d32c64e0cf18d211197946aff7226e0

Listi builds the upstream src/ and include/ content into its interactive terminal.
The local scrollback callback carries line continuation before libvterm moves
its row metadata, so clipboard selections preserve logical lines.
Three trailing whitespace runs are removed for clean import.
